SUMMARY:Puzzle Swap
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Bull City Puzzle Swap at Durham East Regional 
 Library! All ages welcome.\n\nExchange your adult and children's gently 
 used jigsaw puzzles for new-to-you puzzles. Please be sure to check for 
 missing puzzle pieces before you bring them in. All remaining puzzles will 
 be given to Bull City Puzzle Swap for future events. This is a drop-in 
 event\, so come anytime during the 2 hours!\n\nBe sure to check out Bull 
 City Puzzle Swap's Facebook page: 
