BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260921T213000Z
DTEND:20260921T223000Z
DTSTAMP:20260921T000000Z
SUMMARY:*CANCELED* The Sunday Scaries: Calm the Worry Before the Week Begins
DESCRIPTION:Does Sunday night come with a knot in your stomach? The 
 weekend's almost gone\, the upcoming week is already full\, and that low 
 hum of dread creeps in. You're not alone\, but the Sunday Scaries don’t 
 have to ruin your weekend or the week ahead.\n\nIn this workshop\, we'll 
 look at what those Sunday Scaries really are and why they hit hard as the 
 fall calendar fills up. Together we’ll try simple\, practical ways to 
 quiet a racing mind that can work anywhere: in the car\, at the kitchen 
 sink\, or when sleep feels far away. You'll leave with a small plan so next 
 Sunday feels steadier. Bring a pen\, some paper or your favorite journal\, 
 and your real self.\n\nLed by Laura Bey\, a National Board-Certified Health 
 and Wellness Coach based in Durham.
LOCATION:Meeting Room #4347\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Alexandra Wurst":MAILTO:awurst@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Business, Career Development, Community Engagement, Low Sensory Stimulation
