SUMMARY:Middle Earth Diamond Painting @ North Regional
DESCRIPTION:Step into the legendary world of "The Lord of the Rings" with 
 this immersive\, fantasy-themed diamond painting experience. Inspired by 
 the epic journey across Middle Earth\, we will transform iconic scenes into 
 breathtaking\, sparkling mosaic artwork. All materials will be 
 provided.\n\nRegistration is required to claim your place in this gathering 
 of kindred spirits.\n\nFor your presence\, you will earn an extra entry 
 into the One Walk to Rule Them All grand prize drawing with submission of a 
 completed tracker. \n\nThis program is made possible through the generosity 
