 storytelling! Teens will learn to make simple\, delicious recipes while 
 discovering new books\, characters\, and genres. Each session features an 
 easy snack to prepare\, followed by a relaxed reading session inspired by 
 the theme of the day. No cooking experience needed—just curiosity\, 
 creativity\, and a good appetite. All supplies are provided!\n
