SUMMARY:CANCELLED - Family Voices / Voces de Familia
DESCRIPTION:Due to various factors\, today's session has been cancelled. We 
 will meet again on October 7th at SLW. // Debido a varios factores\, la 
 sesión del día de hoy quedo cancelada. Nos volveremos a reunir el 7 de 
 octubre en la Biblioteca SLW. \n\nThis program will have be a 6-week series 
 for the whole family. \nChildcare available for children under five. 
 \n\nRegistration is highly encouraged through partners website.\n\n 
 \n\nSessions are held Wednesdays\, September 2nd\, 9th\, 16th\, 23rd and 
 October 7th and 14th at Stanford L. Warren Library\, 1201 Fayetteville St. 
 \n\nAdult Workshop: Story Sharing\n\n\n	Build relationships and connect 
 with your neighbors\n	Discover helpful resources that support your child's 
 success at home\, in school and beyond. \n	Shape the program with your 
 voice\n	Engaging fun activities\n\n\nFor each 
