DTSTART:20260923T220000Z
DTEND:20260923T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260923T000000Z
SUMMARY:Learn to Crochet with Gandalf the Grey
DESCRIPTION:Become a wizard with a crochet hook! Learn to crochet a 
 beginner friendly Gandalf from The Woobles! Each participant will receive a 
 kit that contains everything you need to learn how to crochet\, including 
 yarn\, crochet hook\, and access to detailed instructional videos for both 
 right and left-handed crocheters. This program is for beginners wanting to 
 learn how to crochet\, if you’re a capable crocheter\, please pass this 
 one by!\n\nRegistration\, attendance\, and participation at the first 
 session are required to receive a Woobles kit. The session on October 28th 
 is an optional help session. \n\nYou can earn an extra entry into the One 
 Walk to Rule Them All grand prize drawing by attending this program with 
 submission of a completed tracker.\n\nThis program is made possible through 
 the generosity of the Friends of the Durham Library.
LOCATION:Adult Programming Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Jessica L.":MAILTO:jllundin@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Friends of the Durham Library, One Walk
