SUMMARY:Small is All Productions Presents: Circle & Square @ Southwest - Postponed
DESCRIPTION:Due to unforeseen circumstances\, this performance has been 
 postponed to a later date. We apologize for the inconvenience. \n\nJoin 
 Small is All Productions for Circle and Square\, a play designed for ages 
 2-5 and their parents/caregivers to attend and enjoy together. In this 
 interactive\, mostly nonverbal story\, audiences meet the free spirit 
 Circle\, followed by highly structured Square. These two characters have a 
 hard time figuring out how to play together because they are so different. 
 Throughout the play\, Circle and Square discover each other's unique gifts 
 and how they can be combined to have even more fun together than 
 apart.\n\nRegistration required - registration will open 3 weeks before the 
 event. Questions? Please call (919) 560-8592 or email Kristen at 
 kstockdale@dconc.gov.\n\nThis program is sponsored by the Durham Library 
 Foundation.\n\n \n\nIf you have questions about accessibility\, program 
 stimulation levels\, and/or need disability accommodations\, please contact 
 us at (919) 560-8592. \n\n\n\n
LOCATION:Southwest Meeting Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Kristen Stockdale":MAILTO:kstockdale@dconc.gov
