 scheduled for: August 29\, Sept 12\, Sept. 26\, Oct. 10\, Oct. 17\, and 
 Oct. 24. To complete all activities\, tweens and teens will need to attend 
 all six sessions. For tweens (ages 9 and up) and teens\n\nRegistration is 
