SUMMARY:SoDu Red\, White and Blue Get Out the Vote Kickoff Party!
DESCRIPTION:Join You Can Vote and the Durham County Library anytime between 
 1 - 5 pm at the South Regional Library for a fun and informational 
 non-partisan Get Out the Vote event! There will be activities (for kids 
 too!) a story time\, music\, including Batalá Durham\, and more... PLUS 
 there will be information available about all things voting\, including 
 early voting sites\, Board of Elections phone app information\, check voter 
 registration status\, register to vote\, and more! Drop by anytime between 
 1 and 5 to get your questions answered\, and most importantly\, have fun! 
 \n\n
LOCATION:South Meeting Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Jessica L.":MAILTO:jllundin@dconc.gov
