SUMMARY:Looney Tunes & Slime Making!!
DESCRIPTION:"Th-th-that-that's all folks!" - Porky Pig\n\n \n\nDaffy Duck 
 and Porky Pig are back and better than ever! Join us in the Children's 
 Programming Room for a special screening of Looney Tunes: The Day The Earth 
 Blew Up\, a recent hidden gem set in the world of Looney Tunes. We'll be 
 watching this excellent flick and making some real slime too! Come on down 
 and get ready for a great interactive movie-watching experience!\n\n 
