DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
SUMMARY:One Walk to Rule Them All Exercise Challenge
DESCRIPTION:Join us for One Walk to Rule Them All\, a Lord of the 
 Rings-themed exercise initiative that will inspire you to participate in 
 your favorite types of exercises! To participate\, simply pick up a printed 
 tracker from either South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave.) or North 
 Regional Library (221 Milton Rd) or click HERE to request a printable PDF 
 via email. Trackers will be available beginning August 24th.\n\nHow it 
 works: \n\n\n	You have until November 30th to complete at least four of the 
 five challenges listed on the tracker. \n	You can join in at any time 
 during September\, October\, or November!\n	You can do any type of exercise 
 or physical activity you like! \n	Use your tracker to track the number of 
 minutes you exercise.\n	For each challenge on the tracker you complete\, 
 bring your tracker in to South Regional Library or North Regional Library 
 to claim your completion button for that challenge. You will also receive a 
 lanyard upon your first visit. (while supplies last). If you prefer\, you 
 can claim them all at the end of the challenge.\n	Return your tracker to 
 South or North Regional by December 10th to be entered into the grand prize 
 raffle. \n	If you complete all five challenges on the tracker\, you earn 
 two entries.\n	You can earn extra entries into the raffle by attending 
 specific programs/events throughout September\, October and November. Click 
 HERE for a list of those programs. You must return a completed tracker to 
 be eligible to receive extra entries.\n	All ages are welcome to 
 participate\, however we do not have separate prizes for different age 
 groups. \n\n\nThere will be five winners! The Grand Prizes are: \n\n\n	Two 
 Fitbit Charges\n	Two Lord of the Rings themed gift bags filled with some 
 cool LOTR stuff. \n	One Lord of the Rings Lego set (Balrog book 
 nook)\n\n\nQuestions? Please contact Jessica at jllundin@dconc.gov\n\nOne 
 Walk to Rule Them All is made possible through the generosity of the 
 Friends of the Durham Library.\n
LOCATION:South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Jessica L.":MAILTO:jllundin@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Announcements, Friends of the Durham Library, Health & Fitness
UID:LibCal-14288-16258385
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16258385
END:VEVENT
