SUMMARY:Computer Classes: AI Basics
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a class on Artificial Intelligence (AI). We will go 
 over basic definitions\, major benefits and concerns being discussed around 
 AI\, how to develop efficient prompts\, and tips for safety and spotting AI 
 generated content.\n\nThis class is a part of a series of computer classes. 
