SUMMARY:Make Your Own Pride Parade Sign
DESCRIPTION:Join the Maker   STEAM Team in the 3rd floor Innovation Lab 
 during specified open hours to make your own Pride Parade sign!\n\nDurham's 
 Pride Parade is Saturday\, Oct 3rd from 12-2pm around Duke's East Campus. 
 We will have poster-making supplies out in the Innovation Lab for you to 
 make your own sign to bring to the parade if you would like to show your 
 pride and support of our community. \n\nThis is a self-paced activity. You 
 can drop in during the listed Open Lab Hours.\n\nInnovation Lab Open 
 Hours:\n\nMonday: Closed\nTuesday: 1pm - 5pm\nWednesday: 3pm 
 -7pm\nThursday: 10am - 2pm\nFriday: 1pm - 5pm\nSaturday: 11am - 1pm and 3pm 
 - 5pm\n\nHours subject to change based on staffing and programming needs.
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="James McKinnell":MAILTO:jmckinnell@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Innovation Lab, Maker, STEAM
