SUMMARY:Fall SCORE Networking & Panel
DESCRIPTION:\na {\n    text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr 
 th\, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    
 background-color: #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n\n\nJoin us for a lively and informative 
 panel featuring local SCORE mentors as they share their backgrounds\, 
 business specialties\, and practical advice for entrepreneurs at any stage. 
 Learn how SCORE’s free mentoring\, workshops\, and resources can support 
 your business goals\, and discover how the library partners with them to 
 offer ongoing programs for our Durham's entrepreneurial community.\n\nAfter 
 the panel\, stay for a relaxed networking session where you can meet the 
 mentors one-on-one\, connect with fellow entrepreneurs\, and explore the 
 library’s business services and tools. This event offers a great 
 opportunity for anyone interested in becoming a SCORE mentor and learning 
 more about the library's tools.\n\nWhether you’re launching a new idea\, 
 growing your business\, or looking to give back as a mentor\, this session 
 will help you make valuable connections and learn about the resources 
 available to you.
LOCATION:Main Auditorium\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Ciera Williams":MAILTO:cbwilliams@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Business, Career Development
