 with your friends? Join us for Teen Craft & Connect! Each session features 
 an easy\, hands‑on craft you can personalize and take home- no experience 
 needed. Come hang out\, try something new\, and make cool creations while 
 connecting with other teens in a low‑pressure\, welcoming environment. 
