SUMMARY:All Things STEAM: Let's Learn About Spinal Cords!
DESCRIPTION:To all youths ages 7-11 years and their caregivers: join Ms. 
 Natalie to explore STEAM (Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, Art\, and 
 Mathematics)! Every first Thursday of the month\, we will discuss a 
 different STEAM topic and further our learning with a hands-on activity or 
 craft.\n\nTo celebrate World Spine Day (10/16)\, we will learn all about 
 spinal cords and create our own models of the spine using beads\, Life 
 Savers Gummies\, pasta\, pipe cleaners\, and scissors!\n\nRegistration is 
 required.\n\nIf you have questions about accessibility\, program 
 stimulation levels\, and/or need disability accommodations\, please contact 
 us at (919) 560-8592.
