SUMMARY:Trick or Pickle Scavenger Hunt @ Southwest Regional
DESCRIPTION:For October's scavenger hunt\, we’ve hidden pictures of 10 
 pickles in costume throughout the children’s area of the library (in 
 honor of Halloween)... Can you find them all?!\n\nThis scavenger hunt will 
 run from Oct. 1st through Oct. 31st!\n\nIf you have questions about 
 accessibility\, program stimulation levels\, and/or need disability 
 accommodations\, please contact us at (919) 560-8592.
