 genres. Each meeting\, we will discuss the craft of writing and review each 
 other's works. To submit an item for critique\, email dpeterson@dconc.gov 
 by Sept 17. Registered attendees will receive works to review on Sept 18. 
 Email dpeterson@dconc.gov with questions or to register after registration 
 has closed.
