SUMMARY:CANCELLED: Duke Ballet & Books
DESCRIPTION:The October 3 class is cancelled. \n---\nDuke Ballet & Books is 
 a group of Duke University student volunteers who run free arts and 
 literacy programming for 6-9 year olds.\n\nThere are two parts to every 
 Ballet & Books session:\n\n1. 45-minute ballet class where students learn 
 choreography to perform at an end-of-semester showcase.\n2. 45-minute 
 reading mentorship session where mentors and students read together and do 
 related activities aimed at helping build literacy skills.\n\nTo learn more 
 and register\, contact duke@balletandbooks.org
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Christina Economou":MAILTO:ceconomou@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Literacy
