SUMMARY:Batman Vs Dracula & Blood Making!
DESCRIPTION:Let's kick off October right! Join us in the Children's 
 Programming Room for a fang-tastic movie paired with some homemade blood 
 making! Watch Batman and Dracula face off against each other for the fate 
 of Gotham City. While the movie is playing\, we will be making homemade 
 blood from corn syrup and red dye. \n\n \n\nRated PG for cartoon violence 
 and suggestive themes\n\n \n\nThe homemade blood is made with dye\, so 
 please don't wear any clothing that you don't want any potential stains on!
