SUMMARY:Life After HUB: Procure & Certify with BIZBRIDGES
DESCRIPTION:What happens when the system changes\, but thousands of 
 businesses still need access\, opportunity\, and support? What are we going 
 to do to support the thousands of businesses that still need access to 
 contracts\, certifications\, procurement opportunities\, capital\, and 
 capacity-building resources?\n\n \n\n​The elimination of North 
 Carolina’s HUB Office and changes resulting from SB 257\, Session Law 
 2026-41 have created new questions for businesses\, procurement 
 professionals\, municipalities\, business support organizations\, and 
 institutions across the state.\n\n​And this conversation is bigger than 
 one demographic. ​HUB did not just impact one group of people. The 
 businesses navigating this new environment represent communities\, 
 industries\, regions\, and backgrounds across North Carolina. \n\n 
 \n\n\n\n​Join BizBridges\, hosted by Chisa Pennix-Brown of Give It To The 
 People® and La-Tasha Best-Gaddy of Infinity Bridges\, Inc.\, for Life 
 After HUB: Procure & Certify\, an important conversation about what comes 
 next.​\n\nWhat We'll Discuss: Attendees will learn about the changing 
 procurement and certification landscape\, opportunities that still exist\, 
 how businesses can better position themselves for contracting\, and what 
 public\, private\, and community partners can do to ensure businesses do 
 not get lost during this transition. We will also welcome guest speakers 
 and procurement\, certification\, government\, economic development\, and 
 business support leaders from across North Carolina to bring multiple 
 perspectives to the conversation.\n\nWho should attend: Business owners\, 
 entrepreneurs\, contractors\, consultants\, vendors\, procurement 
 professionals\, municipalities\, economic development professionals\, 
 business support organizations\, lenders\, nonprofits\, advocates\, and 
 organizations that purchase from or support small businesses.\n\n 
 \n\n\n\nREGISTER HERE: Life After HUB: Procure & Certify By BIZBRIDGES
LOCATION:Computer Lab\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Ciera Williams":MAILTO:cbwilliams@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Business
UID:LibCal-14288-17596189
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17596189
END:VEVENT
