 Silent Book Club from Letters Bookshop to host a Banned Books Read-In to 
 protest book censorship. Join us as we read and take action to fight book 
 bans! \n\nAttendees will also receive a free audio copy of either Banned 
 Together or How to Defend Books and Why\n\n
