SUMMARY:Banned Books Week: Bucket Hat
DESCRIPTION:Combine your freedom to create with your freedom to read. 
 Banned Books Week is an annual event that highlights the value of free and 
 open access to information. Wear your favorite banned books\, quotes\, and 
 decorate a bucket hat.  We will also go over how to use the Cricut and the 
