SUMMARY:STEAM Big: Spooky Lava Lamps
DESCRIPTION:Get into the Halloween spirit by making Spooky Lava Lamps! 
 School-aged children are invited to become mini‑scientists as they 
 discover the immiscible properties of oil and water in this fun STEAM 
 themed craft. Everyone will leave with their very own colorful lava lamp to 
 enjoy all season long\, and beyond! All supplies provided. Registration 
 required.
