SUMMARY:Family Voices / Voces de Familia
DESCRIPTION:This program will have be a 6-week series for the whole family. 
 \nChildcare available for children under five. \n\nRegistration is highly 
 encouraged through partners website.\n\n \n\nSessions are held Wednesdays\, 
 September 2nd\, 9th\, 16th\, 23rd and October 7th and 14th at Stanford L. 
 Warren Library\, 1201 Fayetteville St. \n\nAdult Workshop: Story 
 Sharing\n\n\n	Build relationships and connect with your 
 neighbors\n	Discover helpful resources that support your child's success at 
 home\, in school and beyond. \n	Shape the program with your 
 voice\n	Engaging fun activities\n\n\nFor each 
 session:\n\n\n	Dinner/Breakfast provided\n	Youth 5-14 will participate in a 
 range of fun and educational crafts\n	Childcare for children 5 and 
 under\n\n\nLink for registration\n
LOCATION:SLW Meeting Room - Full Room\, Stanford L. Warren Branch Library (1201 Fayetteville St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Natalia Lucena-Trujillo":MAILTO:nltrujillo@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:
