SUMMARY:Scented Storytime! @ North Regional Library
DESCRIPTION:Join us for storytime and scented activities with Bright Black 
 Candle Co! Through reading\, singing\, and crafts we'll discover the 
 connection of storytelling and scent. All pre-school aged children are 
 welcome! Please register to secure your spot and help us make we have 
 enough materials for everyone. View all Scented Storytimes here: Scented 
 Storytime – Durham County Library
