SUMMARY:Learn to Sew with Connecting with Threads
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to use a sewing machine and how to sew by hand with 
 the non-profit Connecting with Threads. This six-week series of programs 
 enables tweens and teens to build their knowledge as they become 
 independent sewers. They will also be making a project to give to someone 
 in our community--a dog blanket or a pillowcase!\n\nThe six programs are 
 scheduled for: August 29\, Sept 12\, Sept. 26\, Oct. 10\, Oct. 17\, and 
 Oct. 24. To complete all activities\, tweens and teens will need to attend 
 all six sessions. For tweens (ages 9 and up) and teens\n\nRegistration is 
 required! You must register individually for each session you plan to 
 attend.
