SUMMARY:Rain or Shine: Fall Ball at North Regional Library
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with us at our Fall Ball for All! Join us 
 for an afternoon of fun\, creativity\, and community for the whole 
 family.\n\nEnjoy a variety of activities\, including fall-themed crafts\, 
 tasty concessions\, a Baby & Toddler Item Swap\, a Craft Supply Swap\, 
 games\, and more! Bring gently used baby items or craft supplies to swap 
 with others\, discover something new\, and connect with fellow community 
 members.\n\nWhether you’re crafting\, snacking\, swapping\, or simply 
 enjoying the fall atmosphere\, there’s something for everyone!\n\nCome 
 celebrate fall with your library—we can’t wait to see you 
 there!\n\nThis program will be held on October 10\, 2026\, at 10:00 a.m. at 
 North Regional Library. The address is 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 27712.
LOCATION:North Regional - Adult Programming Space\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Chelsea Romero":MAILTO:cromero@dconc.gov
