SUMMARY:Friends of the Durham Library Pop-Up CD Sale
DESCRIPTION:\n\nThe Friends of the Durham Library will conduct a pop-up CD 
 sale at Main Library on Saturday\, October 10\, from 11 a.m. to 2 
 p.m.\n\nThey will have hundreds of CDs in every genre - pop\, rock\, jazz\, 
 blues\, classical\, kids\, bluegrass\, opera\, reggae\, rap\, hip-hop\, 
 etc. - it's all here. They will also have lots of puzzles and games!\n\nCDs 
 are just $1 per disc ( tax). Puzzles and games are either $1 or $3 each ( 
 tax).\n\nThe Friends of the Durham Library is a member-supported\, all 
 volunteer 501(c) (3) non-profit organization. All proceeds support the 
 Durham County Library. For more information\, visit the Friends of the 
 Durham Library website.
LOCATION:Main Library - Café area - 2nd floor\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
