DESCRIPTION:Building Bridges: Communication and Conflict Resolution 
 Workshop\n\nA series of 4 sessions for Spanish-speaking individuals in the 
 Durham area to learn practical tools you can use in daily life to improve 
 communication\, manage conflict\, and strengthen relationships. We ask that 
 you please attend all four sessions to receive a certificate of completion. 
